      "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SVuMa0mW6AM/mqdefault.jpg",
      "description": "Registration is now open for the Last Chance Qualifiers (LCQ) for three titles and the Open Tournaments for two titles at the SNK World Championship 2026 (SWC 2026), the global esports tournament that will determine the world's best SNK fighting game players.\n\nWith a total prize pool of $4,200,000 across both the qualifying tournaments and the Finals, competitors from around the world are invited to join the battle for the world championship title.\n\n■ LCQ:\n- FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves\n- THE KING OF FIGHTERS XV\n- SAMURAI SHODOWN\n\n■ Open tournament:\n- THE KING OF FIGHTERS '98\n- ART OF FIGHTING 3\n\nRegister here: start.gg/swc2026\n\nFor more information, visit snkesports.com\n\n▶ More at:\n⚫ SNK Esports: https://snkesports.com\n⚫ X: https://x.com/snk_esports_hub\n⚫ Instagram: /snk_esports_hub\n⚫ TikTok: /@snk_esports_Hub",
